{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Car Mechanic Workshop, you will repair cars, apply custom paints, upgrade parts from the shop, and test your creations on the circuit. Expand your skills as you build, customize, and fine-tune vehicles in this hands-on mechanic simulator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/d7305dbbdb0faed787bc115f8f4b07f9.poster.avif?t=1772361495\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/d7305dbbdb0faed787bc115f8f4b07f9.webm?t=1772361495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/d7305dbbdb0faed787bc115f8f4b07f9.mp4?t=1772361495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Car Mechanic Workshop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Car Mechanic Workshop, step into the shoes of a skilled mechanic and take on the challenge of repairing, upgrading, and customizing cars. Start with two vehicles, diagnose issues, and replace or upgrade parts using a variety of tools and components from the shop. Add custom paints to create your perfect design, and test your handiwork on the circuit to ensure everything runs smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/820937f715fc651ad179bacb583dc2ae.poster.avif?t=1772361495\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/820937f715fc651ad179bacb583dc2ae.webm?t=1772361495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/820937f715fc651ad179bacb583dc2ae.mp4?t=1772361495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As development progresses, expect a broader roster of vehicles, more intricate repair options, and an expanded selection of parts to enhance performance and style. Whether you're a casual player or a car enthusiast, Car Mechanic Workshop offers a satisfying blend of creativity and mechanical problem-solving.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371650?t=1772361495","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3371650?t=1772361495","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/6d54c7dc95791aef47bf7f07dfa1af4b9b2035ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772361495","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/6d54c7dc95791aef47bf7f07dfa1af4b9b2035ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772361495","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Car Mechanic Workshop!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/0b9c47b103c31b6a2a24035ac39db07d.avif?t=1772361495\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Car Mechanic Workshop, you will repair cars, apply custom paints, upgrade parts from the shop, and test your creations on the circuit. Expand your skills as you build, customize, and fine-tune vehicles in this hands-on mechanic simulator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/d7305dbbdb0faed787bc115f8f4b07f9.poster.avif?t=1772361495\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/d7305dbbdb0faed787bc115f8f4b07f9.webm?t=1772361495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/d7305dbbdb0faed787bc115f8f4b07f9.mp4?t=1772361495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Car Mechanic Workshop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Car Mechanic Workshop, step into the shoes of a skilled mechanic and take on the challenge of repairing, upgrading, and customizing cars. Start with two vehicles, diagnose issues, and replace or upgrade parts using a variety of tools and components from the shop. Add custom paints to create your perfect design, and test your handiwork on the circuit to ensure everything runs smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/820937f715fc651ad179bacb583dc2ae.poster.avif?t=1772361495\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/820937f715fc651ad179bacb583dc2ae.webm?t=1772361495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371650/extras/820937f715fc651ad179bacb583dc2ae.mp4?t=1772361495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As development progresses, expect a broader roster of vehicles, more intricate repair options, and an expanded selection of parts to enhance performance and style. Whether you're a casual player or a car enthusiast, Car Mechanic Workshop offers a satisfyi